# Routing

Route files render a feature screen and navigator options only.

- Import screens from `@/features/<name>`, not from deep feature paths.
- No repositories, no stores, no Expo device APIs in route files.
- Root `_layout.tsx` owns `global.css` and `AppProviders`.
